---
// Fallow terms of use (custom EULA). Shell and styling live in layouts/Legal.astro.
//
// This replaces Apple's standard EULA only if LegalLinks.terms in the app and the EULA
// field in App Store Connect are both pointed here. Until then the app still links to
// Apple's standard EULA and this page is unreferenced.
//
// A custom EULA has to carry at least Apple's "Minimum Terms of Developer's End-User
// License Agreement" (Schedule 1 of the Developer Program Licence Agreement) or review
// rejects it. Those are the "Apple's role in this" and "Legal compliance" sections plus
// the address in "Contact and complaints". Do not delete them to shorten the page.
//
// Keep the entity and contact details in step with privacy-policy.astro.
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';

const CONTACT_EMAIL = 'support@strade.tech';
const LEGAL_ENTITY = 'Strade SMIP SRL, a company established in Romania';
// Apple's minimum EULA terms require a postal address for end user complaints.
const DEVELOPER_ADDRESS = 'Strada Tâmpei 16D, Brașov, Romania';
const GOVERNING_LAW = 'the laws of Romania';

const APPLE_MEDIA_SERVICES = 'https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/';
---

<Legal
  title="Fallow Terms of Use | Strade"
  description="The terms you agree to when you use Fallow, including how the subscription and the Lifetime Unlock work."
  path="/fallow/terms-of-use"
  heading="Terms of Use"
  lastUpdatedISO="2026-08-04"
  lastUpdated="4 August 2026"
>

  <p class="legal-lede">
    Fallow is a self control tool that runs entirely on your device. These terms cover what
    you can expect from it, how the subscription and the Lifetime Unlock work, and the
    limits of what is promised.
  </p>

  <h2>Who these terms are between</h2>
  <p>
    Fallow is published by {LEGAL_ENTITY}, referred to below as "we" or "the developer".
    These terms are an agreement between you and us. Apple is not a party to them.
  </p>
  <p>
    By downloading or using Fallow you accept these terms. If you do not accept them, do not
    use the app.
  </p>

  <h2>Your licence</h2>
  <p>
    We grant you a personal, non transferable licence to use Fallow on Apple branded devices
    that you own or control. Your use is also governed by the Usage Rules in
    <a href={APPLE_MEDIA_SERVICES} class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apple's Media Services Terms and Conditions</a>.
